title: MAMUT-routing-Mamut2026
type: dataset
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the design, generation and diversity-based selection of the Mamut2026 CVRP benchmark. Also credit OpenStreetMap and its contributors for geographic data and Uchoa et al. (2017) for the adopted instance-design vocabulary. Record the exact Git commit used.
